<title>USA: Torch Energy Advisors management buys firm.</title>
<headline>Torch Energy Advisors management buys firm.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Torch Energy Advisors Inc said Wednesday that a management-led purchase of the company from its parent, Torchmark Corp, has closed for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Torch Energy provides outsourcing services for the energy industry.</p>
<p>Torchmark, based in Birmingham, Ala., is an insurance and financial services holding company.</p>
</text>
